Lethathamo ha-ho-fihla: ['kopitsa'] etsa: {
	>> kopitsa := Lethathamo ncha.
	uena e-ngoe-le-e-ngoe: { :palo :section
		kopitsa eketsa-qetellong: section ipheta kopitsa.
	}. <- kopitsa.
}.

>> sheep := Lethathamo ncha ; ['Dolly'] ; ['Shaun']. 
>> clones := sheep kopitsa.
clones e-ngoe-le-e-ngoe: { :palo :sheep
	sheep eketsa-qetellong: ['2'].
}.

Sephetho ngola: sheep, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: clones, mola-o-mocha.
